From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: powerdevil: carry the translated Graphics button in nine languages

The button added by graphics-page-link.patch: its name and its accessible
name in Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, French, German, Japanese, Korean and
Chinese (Simplified and Traditional); English stays in the code.
The translations are a first draft made with AI assistance and need review
by a native speaker.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5
---
